# onnxruntime-node (a dependency of @huggingface/transformers) downloads its CUDA
# provider binaries from NuGet on Linux x64 (Vercel's builders) at install time, and a
# failed download fails the install. Jeannie never runs it: the question embedder is
# the browser build (onnxruntime-web, WASM) in a Web Worker. Skip that download.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
